<title>UK: Czarnikow details 1996/97 world sugar forecast.</title>
<headline>Czarnikow details 1996/97 world sugar forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of Czarnikow Sugar's second estimate of world 1996/97 sugar production and 1997 consumption, issued on Thursday.</p>
<p>All figures are in thousands of tonnes, raw value.</p>
<p>BEET sugar output</p>
<p>	     estimate 1996/97	  1995/96</p>
<p> France		  4,400	    4,601</p>
<p> Germany		 4,325	    4,149</p>
<p> EU TOTAL	     17,032	   17,017</p>
<p> Russia		  1,800	    2,230</p>
<p> Ukraine		 2,825	    3,788</p>
<p> Ex-USSR TOTAL	 5,120	    6,535</p>
<p> Poland		  2,200	    1,720</p>
<p> Turkey		  2,000	    1,520</p>
<p> China		   1,300	    1,403</p>
<p> USA		     3,650	    3,583</p>
<p> TOTAL BEET	   35,948	   36,375</p>
<p>CANE sugar output</p>
<p>	     estimate 1996/97	  1995/96</p>
<p> Cuba		    4,650	    4,525</p>
<p> Brazil		 14,850	   13,594</p>
<p> Mexico		  4,725	    4,732</p>
<p> Indonesia	     2,685	    2,274</p>
<p> India		  16,300	   17,935</p>
<p> Thailand		6,635	    6,350</p>
<p> China		   5,400	    5,367</p>
<p> Pakistan		2,500	    2,663</p>
<p> Philippines	   2,000	    1,775</p>
<p> Australia	     5,615	    5,133</p>
<p> TOTAL CANE	   88,379	   86,810</p>
<p>Key sugar CONSUMPTION figures</p>
<p>	     estimate 1997	     1996</p>
<p> EU TOTAL	     14,400	   14,387</p>
<p> Russia		  5,900	    5,550</p>
<p> ex-USSR TOTAL	10,407	   10,277</p>
<p> Turkey		  1,925	    1,900</p>
<p> EUROPE TOTAL	 31,420	   31,144</p>
<p> Mexico		  4,100	    4,250</p>
<p> USA		     9,000	    8,915</p>
<p> Brazil		  8,500	    8,300</p>
<p> N/C AMERICA TOTAL  17,002	   16,967</p>
<p> S.AMERICA TOTAL    14,453	   14,120</p>
<p> China		   8,600	    8,500</p>
<p> India		  15,200	   14,750</p>
<p> Indonesia	     3,364	    3,252</p>
<p> Pakistan		3,125	    2,935</p>
<p> ASIA TOTAL	   46,145	   44,826</p>
<p> AFRICA TOTAL	 10,323	   10,066</p>
<p> WORLD TOTAL	 120,565	  118,326</p>
